{#- One-page sponsorship agreement (14 Nov 2026, wording approved by Jon). Unlisted; linked from /sponsor/. -#}
<main class="container sponsor-page">
  <section>
    <h1>Sponsorship terms</h1>
    <p class="lead">Plain-English terms for sponsoring the Lenches newsletter and website for one calendar month.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Who:</strong> the person who runs thelenches.org.uk (&ldquo;we&rdquo;) and the business sponsoring it (&ldquo;you&rdquo;).</li>
      <li><strong>What you get:</strong> for the month you book you are the only sponsor. A &ldquo;Supported this month by&rdquo; band with your name, logo, one line of up to 15 words and a link appears near the top of every weekly newsletter sent that month and at the top of the website's home page, plus a thank-you mention in the newsletter.</li>
      <li><strong>Price:</strong> &pound;{{ sponsors.price }}, paid in advance by bank transfer or card before the month starts. We're not VAT registered.</li>
      <li><strong>Content:</strong> you supply the logo and line, and we approve them. We may decline or remove anything misleading, political, gambling-related or unsuitable for a community newsletter.</li>
      <li><strong>Independence:</strong> sponsorship doesn't affect our news, listings or recommendations, and we never share subscriber details with sponsors.</li>
      <li><strong>Term:</strong> one month only, with no automatic renewal. You can book again for another month.</li>
      <li><strong>Ending:</strong> either side may cancel before the month starts for a full refund. If we stop or pause the newsletter during the month, unused weeks are refunded pro rata.</li>
      <li><strong>Liability:</strong> limited to the fee paid. These terms are governed by the law of England and Wales.</li>
    </ol>
    <p><a href="{{ '/sponsor/' | url }}">Back to Sponsor the newsletter</a></p>
  </section>
</main>
